Example: Calculating a Stanley simplicial poset ring
****************************************************

The following is an example of the basic task that this package was written to
accomplish.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : P = fromFVector({1,6,5,1});                                             |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : I = stanleyPosetIdeal(P);                                               |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : Ideal of QQ[x   , x   , x   , x   , x   , x   , x   , x   , x , x , x , |
|                  000   001   010   011   100   101   110   111   1   2   3  |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|x , x ]                                                                      |
| 4   5                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : R = ring(I)/I;                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : getFVector(P)                                                           |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = {1, 6, 5, 1}                                                            |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : isSimplicial(P)                                                         |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = true                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

