isSimplicial -- Determine if a poset is simplicial.
***************************************************

  * Usage: 
        r = isSimplicial(P)
  * Inputs:
      * P, an instance of the type *note Poset: (Posets)Poset,, The poset to be
        tested
  * Outputs:
      * r, a *note Boolean value: (Macaulay2Doc)Boolean,, Whether the given
        poset is simplicial or not

Description
===========

This method uses the *note isBoolean: isBoolean, method to check that every
closed interval of P is a boolean algebra.



+---------------------------+
|i1 : P = booleanLattice(3);|
+---------------------------+
|i2 : isSimplicial(P)       |
|                           |
|o2 = true                  |
+---------------------------+

